{"data":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810853506397655340","created_at":"2024-07-10T01:48:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810853506397655340"],"id":"1810853506397655340","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":49776,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我们老是惦记诗与远方，殊不知，与谁同行比去的远方重要。早安！","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810853506397655340"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810637138003910932","created_at":"2024-07-09T11:28:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810637138003910932"],"id":"1810637138003910932","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":103912,"like_count":100,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我好好想了想上一次xsh 是什么时候。突然，就想了。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810637138003910932"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810478717959012436","created_at":"2024-07-09T00:58:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810478717959012436"],"id":"1810478717959012436","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":74891,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1810352162041667950","type":"quoted"}],"text":"小朋友好多了，送完他上学我也要工作了。等等，先睡20分钟回笼觉。\n\n谢谢大家的关心和鼓励，也谢谢头号粉丝的爱心早餐外卖❗️\n\nHave a nice day♥️ https://t.co/tNlVGvrv7l","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810478717959012436"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810352162041667950","created_at":"2024-07-08T16:36:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810352162041667950"],"id":"1810352162041667950","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":148758,"like_count":97,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":0},"text":"加班的晚上，深夜咳嗽不止不肯睡觉的小朋友。我躺在他身边，头闷在被窝里回邮件。闲暇时手贱打开电报，看到某位男士的电报群里，一群狼友在讨论我。\n\n说我离婚后沦落到做鸡，找金主爸爸找小情人。\n\n我觉得自己是个笑话。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810352162041667950"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810283651227415025","created_at":"2024-07-08T12:03:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810283651227415025"],"id":"1810283651227415025","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":59814,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":0},"text":"女生晚上还是不要穿太短太宽松的睡裤睡觉，否则就会像我这样，大腿到小穴的连接处被蚊子🦟叮了个包，导致现在总觉得下面很痒\n\n这蚊子吃得可真好🙃","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810283651227415025"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810222760020558299","created_at":"2024-07-08T08:01:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810222760020558299"],"id":"1810222760020558299","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":68997,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"经济不好的时候，劳动纠纷的问题确实很多。大家觉得我这个回复有用吗？ https://t.co/PPXluzzfgZ","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810222760020558299"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810189517644874179","created_at":"2024-07-08T05:49:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1810189517644874179"],"id":"1810189517644874179","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":48,"impression_count":97092,"like_count":164,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":16},"text":"今天有推友问我：入职快一年了，单位都不跟他签劳动合同，现在准备辞退他，问怎么办。\n\n我一听就马上恭喜他了：这不明着给你送钱吗？ https://t.co/NETwTwZxNN","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1810189517644874179"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1809613193876238531","created_at":"2024-07-06T15:39:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1809613193876238531"],"id":"1809613193876238531","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":88134,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1809139188983324817","type":"quoted"}],"text":"外翻的肋骨比🐻大\n瘦大晒咩，超～ https://t.co/KB0ltiCSZn","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1809613193876238531"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1809536720289034438","created_at":"2024-07-06T10:35:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1809536720289034438"],"id":"1809536720289034438","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":59375,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":1},"text":"准备生日了，打算带上小朋友去staycation。有没有推荐的适合亲子的酒店呢？\n要求：珠三角地区，有水上项目，不要旧的。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1809536720289034438"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1809243995555737606","created_at":"2024-07-05T15:12:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1809243995555737606"],"id":"1809243995555737606","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":66534,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1808671589279350955","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Exactly… https://t.co/5cjaxChjdn","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1809243995555737606"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1808729306027471125","created_at":"2024-07-04T05:07:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1808729306027471125"],"id":"1808729306027471125","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"中金坠楼员工郑雯露的故事，给我触动很深：\n\n小镇做题家突出重围，名校毕业➕保研。学生时代的她明媚灿烂，周游列国，各种奖学金和含金量十足的实习offer收入囊中。笑容中洋溢着自信。毕业后跻身头部投行，过着金融精英阶层的生活。但高位买房、产后抑郁和降薪的多重debuff，让她结束了自己30岁的生命。\n\n管你是什么精英，大潮之下，都只是蝼蚁罢了。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":87270,"like_count":38,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":2},"text":"中金坠楼员工郑雯露的故事，给我触动很深： https://t.co/yp4WfEczKN","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1808729306027471125"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1808427464357511660","created_at":"2024-07-03T09:08:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1808427464357511660"],"id":"1808427464357511660","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56716,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1808423892119331087","type":"quoted"}],"text":"你那条🦈雕就算了 https://t.co/WRAQfl294v","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1808427464357511660"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1807988562094334435","created_at":"2024-07-02T04:03:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1807988562094334435"],"id":"1807988562094334435","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"触目惊心的对比，很难不让人难过。\n\n同样的绿色场地\n\n绿茵足球场上埃里克森在医疗队和队友的帮助下，跑赢了死神，甚至今年欧洲杯都还能看到他的身影。\n\n小小的亚青赛羽毛球场地上，张志杰的生命却定格在17岁。\n\n这里面可以比较的因素太多了：足球和羽毛球的商业价值、欧洲和东南亚体育行业的基础设施和医疗配备、足联和羽联的制度建设和组织能力、裁判素质和赛场上的人文关怀。\n\n但任何比较都已无法挽回这一令人惋惜的结果。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":67725,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":2},"text":"触目惊心的对比，很难不让人难过。\n\n同样的绿色场地\n\n绿茵足球场上埃里克森在医疗队和队友的帮助下，跑赢了死神，甚至今年欧洲杯都还能看到他的身影。\n\n小小的亚青赛羽毛球场地上，张志杰的生命却定格在17岁。 https://t.co/MGqwG5sl88","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1807988562094334435"}],"errors":[{"detail":"Sorry, you are not authorized to see the Tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [1809139188983324817].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"1809139188983324817","resource_type":"tweet","section":"includes","title":"Authorization Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/not-authorized-for-resource","value":"1809139188983324817"},{"detail":"Sorry, you are not authorized to see the Tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [1808671589279350955].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"1808671589279350955","resource_type":"tweet","section":"includes","title":"Authorization Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/not-authorized-for-resource","value":"1808671589279350955"},{"detail":"Sorry, you are not authorized to see the Tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [1808423892119331087].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"1808423892119331087","resource_type":"tweet","section":"includes","title":"Authorization Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/not-authorized-for-resource","value":"1808423892119331087"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","conversation_id":"1810352162041667950","created_at":"2024-07-08T16:36:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet